<title>AUSTRALIA: Technical problems delay Australian share trading.</title>
<headline>Technical problems delay Australian share trading.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian Stock Exchange (ASX) said on Tuesday that trading has been halted due to technical difficulties with its SEATS trading system.</p>
</text>
